      "priority": "core",
      "order": 20,
      "front": "What is a sprocket, in one sentence?",
      "back": "A toothed wheel that a widget drives.",
      "explanation": "Sprockets are what widgets move, so they come second.",
      "example": "Like a bicycle cog, turned by a widget.",
